BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tomboy
DTSTART:20250725T003000Z
DTEND:20250725T021500Z
DTSTAMP:20250725T003000Z
UID:nodF2goyY6
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 84 mins (1h24m)\n\nTomboy tells the story of ten-yea
 r-old Laure (the amazing Zoé Héran)\, who moves to the suburbs and decid
 es to pass as a boy named Mikael among the pack of neighborhood kids. Mika
 el catches the attention of leader of the pack Lisa\, who becomes smitten.
  Laure/Mikael code-switches between being at home with their family and ha
 nging out with their neighborhood pals and new girlfriend — all the whil
 e finding resourceful ways to navigate the summer. This second feature fro
 m Céline Sciamma (Portrait of a Lady on Fire) is an astute and moving exp
 loration of childhood gender nonconformity.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema
 /in-theaters/tomboy
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tangerine
DTSTART:20250725T024500Z
DTEND:20250725T043500Z
DTSTAMP:20250725T024500Z
UID:YYrfKKrT3V
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 89 mins (1h29m)\n\nThis refreshingly hilarious and r
 aunchy comedy follows scrappy transgender prostitute besties Sin-Dee and A
 lexandra on a wild night in L.A. filled with sassy repartee ("Merry Christ
 mas Eve\, bitch")\, adultering pimps\, nightclub debuts\, and capital "d" 
 D-RAMA! Featuring exclusive content from Sean Baker and Samantha Quan\, in
 cluding a post-film Q&A.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/tanger
 ine
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sorry\, Baby
DTSTART:20250725T231500Z
DTEND:20250726T012000Z
DTSTAMP:20250725T231500Z
UID:3JqrooWKwM
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 104 mins (1h44m)\n\nEva Victor (“Billions”) writ
 es\, directs\, and stars in this nonlinear\, seriocomic story about a mela
 ncholic English professor’s complicated path toward healing in the after
 math of an all-to-common tragedy. Winner of the Sundance 2025 Waldo Salt S
 creenwriting Award.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/sorry-baby
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 2\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
